<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- Bottom tab bar icons — 24x24 viewbox, centred, ~20x20 live area.
         Home traces the desktop sidebar's Home PNG. Favorites and Search draw the desktop's glyphs (Noctis.UI Assets/Icons.axaml, copied
         verbatim). Playlists and Library keep the phone's own: the desktop sidebar draws its
         Playlists entry from a PNG mask (Playlist icon.png, no vector exists) and has no Library
         entry. Phone outline set = 1.8u stroke (round caps/joins) expanded to fill; filled set =
         same silhouette, interior details knocked out.
         Each string carries the grid's corners ("M0 0ZM24 24Z", zero-area) so PathIcon's
         uniform stretch keeps the 24-grid: one box size draws every tab at the same weight. -->

    <!-- ═══ Home: desktop Home ICON.png (the sidebar's Home), traced like LibraryIcons'
